  Summary Comparison
Feature 	                                            Stack	Heap
Allocation Time	Runtime (when function is called)	    Runtime (when needed)
Management	Automatic (by compiler/CPU)	              Manual/Garbage Collected
Speed	Fast	                                          Slower
Size	Small, fixed	                                  Large, flexible
Lifetime	Limited to function scope	                  Until explicitly freed
